     "text": "Explored the tree. Relevant files: src/config/loader.js (loadConfig + formatV1) and src/render/panel.js (init/currentPanels). src/legacy/exporter.js is deprecated and should stay untouched. One trap found: formatV1's trailing #v1 line is load-bearing — external dashboards grep for it, so any refactor must keep the output byte-identical. Proposed plan: add reloadConfig(path?) to loader.js (re-read + merge over DEFAULTS) and refresh() to panel.js that reloads and returns the new config. Acceptance: node verify.js exits 0.",
